{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RemovedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The collection holds each entity that lost a ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", whether the component was removed or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity despawned, oldest first. The following system scores a point for each entity that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thawed:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@System","struct CountThawed {","    func run(_ thawed: RemovedComponents<Frozen>, _ score: ResourceWriter<Score>) {","        score.value.points += thawed.count","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Score(points: 0))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Frozen())","let frame = Schedule { CountThawed() }","frame.run(on: &world)","","world.remove(Frozen.self, from: statue)","frame.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[Score.self].points)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The schedule starts recording removals of "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\